[I] A Lua SAX XML parser based on Expat

[T] LuaExpat is a SAX XML parser based on the Expat library.

[U] https://github.com/lunarmodules/luaexpat/

[A] Roberto Ierusalimschy
[A] André Carregal
[A] Tomás Guisasola
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[L] OpenSource

[V] 1.5.2

[D] 1e537870f1dcd22a331bc77ad43dad39b7e5860a16befb8923ccf593 luaexpat-1.5.2.tar.gz https://github.com/lunarmodules/luaexpat/archive/1.5.2/

# inherit some stuff like myCFLAGS, myLIBS

. $base/package/*/*/lua-conf.in

var_append makeopt ' ' "LUA_V=$luaver LUA_INC=-I/$(pkgprefix includedir lua) EXPAT_INC="
var_append makeinstopt ' ' "LUA_V=$luaver LUA_CDIR=$pkglibdir LUA_LDIR=$pkgdatadir"
